 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1995-09-28",
   "text": "Tongass Transfer and Transition Act - Provides for the transfer to Alaska of the Tongass National Forest if so elected by Alaska within a specified period of time. Sets forth transition provisions, including: (1) reinstatement of the Alaska Pulp Corporation; (2) creation of a timber road revolving fund; (3) land grants to Native Alaskans; and (4) timber and mining provisions."
  }
